sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Screen
    participant Dl as AndroidDownloader
    participant DM as DownloadManager
    participant API as MedRational API

    User->>Screen: tap Download
    Screen->>Dl: downloadFile(url, fileName)
    Dl->>Dl: freshAccessToken()<br/>(renews if the JWT expires within 5 min)
    Dl->>DM: enqueue with Authorization header
    DM->>API: GET /downloads/file/{id}
    API->>API: record the download (Recent downloads)
    API-->>DM: file
    DM-->>User: system notification, file in Downloads
